    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“At that time the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, ‘Hew two tables of stone like the first, and come up to me on the mountain, and make an ark of wood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will write on the tables the words that were on the first tables which you broke, and you shall put them in the ark.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I made an ark of acacia wood, and hewed two tables of stone like the first, and went up the mountain with the two tables in my hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he wrote on the tables, as at the first writing, the ten commandments",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10.4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "words",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had spoken to you on the mountain out of the midst of the fire on the day of the assembly; and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gave them to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I turned and came down from the mountain, and put the tables in the ark which I had made; and there they are, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(The people of Israel journeyed from Be-eroth Bene-jaakan",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the wells of the Bene-jaakan",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to Moserah. There Aaron died, and there he was buried; and his son Eleazar ministered as priest in his stead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From there they journeyed to Gudgodah, and from Gudgodah to Jotbathah, a land with brooks of water. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that time the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " set apart the tribe of Levi to carry the ark of the covenant of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", to stand before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to minister to him and to bless in his name, to this day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore Levi has no portion or inheritance with his brothers; the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is his inheritance, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God said to him.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I stayed on the mountain, as at the first time, forty days and forty nights, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " hearkened to me that time also; the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was unwilling to destroy you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, ‘Arise, go on your journey at the head of the people, that they may go in and possess the land, which I swore to their fathers to give them.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And now, Israel, what does the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God require of you, but to fear the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, to walk in all his ways, to love him, to serve the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God with all your heart and with all your soul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to keep the commandments and statutes of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", which I command you this day for your good? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God belong heaven and the heaven of heavens, the earth with all that is in it; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yet the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " set his heart in love upon your fathers and chose their descendants after them, you above all peoples, as at this day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Circumcise therefore the foreskin of your heart, and be no longer stubborn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.10.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 10.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.2.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 2.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 17.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God is God of gods and Lord of lords, the great, the mighty, and the terrible God, who is not partial and takes no bribe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He executes justice for the fatherless and the widow, and loves the sojourner, giving him food and clothing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.22.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 22.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 19.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Love the sojourner therefore; for you were sojourners in the land of Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall fear the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God; you shall serve him and cleave to him, and by his name you shall swear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is your praise; he is your God, who has done for you these great and terrible things which your eyes have seen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
